cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Feynman Studio for the figures of a paper or a thesis, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Feynman Studio: a web editor for many-body Feynman diagrams"
abstract: >-
  Feynman Studio is a browser-based editor for the diagrams of many-body and
  condensed-matter theory: Green's functions, self-energies, phonon propagators,
  vertex functions and two-particle kernels, on and off equilibrium. Labels are
  LaTeX; diagrams are exported to TikZ, SVG, PDF and PNG.
authors:
